  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is rank three, and one jun is thirty jin.",
        "chapters": [
          442
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Unlike a single beast strength Gu such as kunlun bull strength Gu, Jun Strength Gu can be stacked until the body’s limit is reached. It still has the common weaknesses of strength path. When Fang Yuan injects primeval essence into it, the Gu flies above his head, gives off a strange light, and steadily modifies his body.",
        "chapters": [
          443
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_strength_gu",
          "path_strength"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Jin Strength Gu and Jun Strength Gu recipes were the invention of a rank seven Gu Immortal. Compared with traditional beast strength Gu they were easier to refine and cost less, and they were widespread in the north. Fang Yuan abandons beast phantom Gu for Jun Strength Gu to keep up with that development and to disguise his identity, but Jun Strength Gu still cannot solve the fundamental problem of strength path.",
        "chapters": [
          500
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "line-choice-and-limits",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
